    {
      "id": "fig03_content_and_complexity",
      "title": "Content and complexity",
      "caption": "上排将 G1b 的真实内容与度匹配置换区分；下排展示完整 support 相对单条 cache 未建立额外收益，19题净增益全在确定性 regime。不同任务分母分别标出，不将均匀先验41.8%当视觉基线。",
      "sources": [
        "results/auditor/interaction_graph_g1b_summary.json",
        "results/auditor/interaction_graph_ladder 2.json"
      ],
      "placement": "main",
      "out_of_canvas_text": []
    },
    {
      "id": "fig04_structural_opportunity",
      "title": "Structural opportunity",
      "caption": "左图保留19个点与样本大小差异，内部名义多后继与严格G-branch用连接标记区分；不画“联合区间为空”的误导图。中/右为同10个人工窗口的折叠与访问分布，不把30个keystep窗口当成配对对照。",
      "sources": [
        "results/auditor/b2_egoexo/paper_regime_points.json",
        "results/auditor/b2_egoexo/b2_bike_fold_r1.json"
      ],
      "placement": "main",
      "out_of_canvas_text": []
    },
    {
      "id": "fig05_oracle_online",
      "title": "Oracle-to-online gap",
      "caption": "分别绘两阶段与soft融合，不混算；右侧将oracle与预测查询的harmful override并列。Full同时改变转移与原型，不作单因素因果归因。准确率是点估计，未伪造绝对准确率区间。",
      "sources": [
        "results/graph_u1/d_twostage_reproduction.json",
        "results/graph_u1/d_soft_reproduction.json"
      ],
      "placement": "main",
      "out_of_canvas_text": []
    },
    {
      "id": "fig06_u1_final_controls",
      "title": "U1 final conditions and controls",
      "caption": "主表只用最终因果+校准版本；右图必须和B>V一起出现。真实support 73.91%、打乱均值73.60%，CI跨零；不能解释为uncertainty-aware memory已成功。bootstrap类型标清，停止状态与未运行FBG写在图内。",
      "sources": [
